@startuml Client Thread Model

title Client: Traad-kommunikation (NotePi eksempel)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam participantPadding 10

participant "Qt Main Thread\n(UI + event loop)" as QT
participant "Network Thread\n(lws event loop)" as NET
participant "NoteReader Thread\n(audio + pitch)" as AUDIO

== Opstart ==
QT -> QT: app.exec() starter Qt event loop
QT -> NET: std::thread(GameClient::run)
QT -> AUDIO: noteReader.start()\n-> std::thread(NoteReader::loop)

== Performer spiller tone ==
AUDIO -> AUDIO: CoreAudio callback\n-> ring buffer\n-> aubio pitch\n-> "A" detekteret

AUDIO -[#blue]-> QT: **QMetaObject::invokeMethod**\n(&window, [note="A"]{...},\nQt::QueuedConnection)
note right of AUDIO: Lambda postes til\nQt event queue.\nAudio-traad blokerer IKKE.

QT -> QT: Lambda koerer:\nwindow.addDetectedNote("A")\n-> NotePiScreen viser "A"

== Performer trykker SUBMIT ==
QT -> NET: game->submitNotes(["A","C",...])\n-> mutex-beskyttet queue\n-> lws_cancel_service() (vaekker lws)

NET -> NET: lws_service() -> onWritable()\n-> sender note_submit JSON

== Server svarer ==
NET -> NET: lws_service() -> onMessage()\n-> parser note_state

NET -[#blue]-> QT: **QMetaObject::invokeMethod**\n(&window, [noteState]{...},\nQt::QueuedConnection)

QT -> QT: Lambda koerer:\nwindow.updateNoteState(state)\n-> NotePiScreen viser farver

== Game Over ==
NET -> NET: Modtager game_over besked

NET -[#blue]-> QT: **QMetaObject::invokeMethod**\n(&window, [win, lb, ...]{...},\nQt::QueuedConnection)
note right of NET: VIGTIGT: gyro.stop() og\nnoteReader.stop() kaldes\ni Qt-lambdaen, IKKE her.\n(Undgar at blokere lws)

QT -> QT: gyro.stop()\nnoteReader.stop()
QT -> AUDIO: running_ = false\nthread_.join()
note over AUDIO: Traaden stopper

QT -> QT: window.showGameOver(...)

note over QT: **GYLDEN REGEL:**\nUI maa KUN opdateres\nfra Qt main thread.\nAndre traade bruger\ninvokeMethod + QueuedConnection.

@enduml
